<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>form</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Express urlencoded test</h1>

    <form action="/register" method="post">
        <label for="username">Nome</label>
        <input type="text" name="username" id="username">
        <button type="submit">Enviar</button>
    </form>

    <p><strong>O terminal server side deve imprimir o nome após submeter (enviar) para garantir que o middleware urlencoded esteja funcionando corretamente</strong></p>
</body>
</html>